{"id":6,"jsonrpc":"2.0","result":{"contents":{"kind":"plaintext","value":"decode(bytes: [u8], order: byte_order = …) -> result\n\nDecode exactly one fixed-width number without modifying or retaining the input.\nSupports i8/u8, i16/u16, i32/u32, i64/u64 and f32/f64; other types fail compilation.\nEvery exact-width bit pattern is valid, including infinities and all IEEE NaNs.\n\nReturns: Ok with the exact represented number, or a managed wrong_width error for a count mismatch."},"range":{"end":{"character":30,"line":4},"start":{"character":24,"line":4}}}}Content-Length: 196

